Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 aiuon (https://github.com/aiuon)

What this licence covers
------------------------
This licence covers the DKC32X project's own source code, scripts, data tables and
documentation in this repository. It does NOT cover:

  * the third-party parts listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which keep their own licences
    (for example sh/start.s (MIT), tools/emu/libretro.h (MIT), the programs and patches
    described in tools/win/licenses/, and the 32X boot code in md/blob.inc);
  * tools/meta/layout.json.gz, which is derived from a GPL-3.0 work and is provided under the
    GNU General Public License version 3 (LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt). The additional terms below do
    not apply to that file;
  * Donkey Kong Country itself. This repository contains no game code, graphics, sound or other
    data from the original game, and no licence to the game is given or implied.

